  "summary": "This scan found only one item, and it is low severity: an extra administrator account on this computer that you should simply confirm you recognize. Nothing else was flagged, so the computer looks in good shape overall. The first and only thing to do is check whether you know who set up the <computer>\\<account-2> account and why.",
  "groups": [
